        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Held-out fit, knockout, segmentation, and the wavelength FFT are separate functions with the formula named in the docstring. Lean proves the integer trace, not the grid solver. No lean binary was available to check the file." ;
